<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<%- include('partials/head') %>
</head>
<body>
<%- include('partials/header') %>

<main>
  <section class="section-tight bg-soft">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-head center">
        <span class="eyebrow">Our Story</span>
        <h2>Two Brothers, One Simple Mission</h2>
        <p>Honest, high-quality plumbing that customers can trust — that's the whole idea, and it hasn't changed since day one.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="story">
        <div class="story-media">
          <img src="/images/team-two-techs.jpg" alt="Two Lincoln Plumbing & Rooter technicians in front of a company van">
          <div class="story-badge"><strong>2021</strong><span>Company Founded</span></div>
        </div>
        <div class="story-copy">
          <p>Lincoln Plumbing was founded by two brothers with a simple mission: to provide honest, high-quality plumbing services that customers can trust. What started as a small, family-run operation with just a truck, a handful of tools, and a big dream has grown into a well-respected name in the plumbing industry.</p>
          <p>Our journey began with a commitment to hard work and a deep passion for helping people. From fixing leaky faucets to tackling major pipe replacements, we treated every job — big or small — with the same level of care and professionalism. That dedication quickly earned us the trust of homeowners and businesses throughout the community.</p>
          <p>Over the years, Lincoln Plumbing has grown, but our values have never changed. We've built a reputation for reliability, transparency, and quality craftsmanship. With two decades of hands-on experience, our team combines traditional know-how with the latest tools and techniques to deliver solutions that last.</p>
          <p style="font-weight:700; color:var(--ink);">Thank you for trusting Lincoln Plumbing.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section bg-soft">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-head center">
        <span class="eyebrow blue">What Drives Us</span>
        <h2>The Values Behind Every Job</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="services-grid" style="grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);">
        <div class="service-card">
          <div class="service-icon"><%- icons.shield %></div>
          <h3>Honesty First</h3>
          <p>Upfront pricing and straight answers — no upsells, no scare tactics, just what the job actually needs.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="service-card">
          <div class="service-icon"><%- icons.check %></div>
          <h3>Quality Craftsmanship</h3>
          <p>Two decades of hands-on experience means the job gets done right the first time, not just fast.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="service-card">
          <div class="service-icon"><%- icons["map-pin"] %></div>
          <h3>Community Roots</h3>
          <p>Family owned and based in San Bernardino — we live and work in the same neighborhoods we serve.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="story" style="grid-template-columns: 1.05fr 0.95fr;">
        <div class="story-copy">
          <span class="eyebrow">Our Team</span>
          <h2>Trained, Uniformed & Ready</h2>
          <p>Every technician who shows up at your door is a licensed, background-checked member of our crew — trained on the same standards, wearing the same uniform, driving a fully stocked van.</p>
          <p>Our weekly team trainings keep everyone sharp on the latest techniques, from hydrojetting to leak detection, so the person at your door is never guessing.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="story-media">
          <img src="/images/team-training.jpg" alt="Lincoln Plumbing & Rooter team training session">
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="usp-row">
        <div class="usp-item"><strong>20+</strong><span>Years Hands-On Experience</span></div>
        <div class="usp-item"><strong>#1111400</strong><span>Contractor License</span></div>
        <div class="usp-item"><strong>24/7</strong><span>Emergency Availability</span></div>
        <div class="usp-item"><strong>Free</strong><span>In-Person Estimates</span></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section-tight bg-ink">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="cta-band" style="background:none; padding:0;">
        <div>
          <h2>Ready to work with a team that treats your home like their own?</h2>
          <p>Call now for 24/7 emergency service, or book a free in-person estimate.</p>
        </div>
        <div style="display:flex; gap:12px; flex-wrap:wrap;">
          <a href="<%= site.phoneHref %>" class="btn btn-primary">Call <%= site.phone %></a>
          <a href="/contact" class="btn btn-secondary" style="border-color:rgba(255,255,255,0.6); color:#fff;">Free Estimate</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</main>

<%- include('partials/footer') %>
</body>
</html>
